ype":"Point","coordinates":[135.1308135986328,35.19205093383789]}}],"display_comment_original":"丹波市には、地域の由緒を示す案内板や石碑を探す余地がある。 まずは社寺・地域信仰、近代化・産業遺産、自然と信仰を軸に、地区の由緒を拾える場所を探したい。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を、既存ピンと照らして歩くと発見しやすい。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":["春日局"],"notable_people":["春日局","田捨女","大西瀧治郎","田健治郎","深尾須磨子"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":[],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":["柏原藩","三田藩","鶴牧藩"],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["黒井城跡 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/bunka-138894"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%B9%E6%B3%A2%E5%B8%82","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q835747","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11576809","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q358002","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q707834","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11559965","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11606114","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11594983","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11516592","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q17211664","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11358929","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E5%B1%80&keyword=%E4%B8%B9%E6%B3%A2%E5%B8%82"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"丹波市","wikipedia_revision_id":"110796319","wikidata_qid":"Q877196","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%B9%E6%B3%A2%E5%B8%82","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E5%B1%80&keyword=%E4%B8%B9%E6%B3%A2%E5%B8%82","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}